  message: "Fixed in PR #2276 (c7962ddd2): cfg._process_deferred gives a deferred/later-run closure a region, DdgEdge.late_region carries it, go.yaml later_call [go_statement], taint._sink_runs_after_source orders by execution. Live re-run on dev 3c109b3aa: filed repro go_defer_noalias -> violated rc 1 (was confirmed_with_caveats 3), control go_defer_noalias_ctrl violated rc 1. Sweep (fast_smart_test_build_11172026/closure_pr2/tivok_sweep.txt), each with control violated: go_defer_closure, go_defer_closure_arg, go_goroutine, js_process_exit, js_then, py_atexit_lambda, py_exitstack, py_finally -> violated 1. Precision fixtures stay confirmed_with_caveats 3 as they should: go_defer_direct (args evaluated at defer), go_defer_static, go_iife. Stated limits in docs/VERIFY-CLAIMS-SCOPE.md: py_atexit (callback registered by name: confirmed 0, no flow; a references edge, not a call), rs_drop (Drop::drop: confirmed_with_caveats 3, no flow), go_stored_called_before (closure stored and called before the assignment: now violated, a false positive). Tests test_taint_deferred_sink_order.py (18); 13/13 mutations red."  # 7a2e
